@startuml
title Todo - Create Todo (POST /api/todos)
hide footbox
actor Client
participant TodoController
participant TodoService
participant AppUserRepository
participant TodoRepository
participant GlobalExceptionHandler as GEH

Client -> TodoController: POST /api/todos {title, description}
note right of Client: Already authenticated by JwtAuthenticationFilter\nSecurityConfig: /api/todos/** requires role USER

alt Request body fails @Valid (title blank or longer than 200)
    TodoController --> GEH: MethodArgumentNotValidException
    GEH --> Client: 400 Bad Request (field errors)
else Request body is valid
    TodoController -> TodoService: createTodo(principal.getUserId(), request)
    TodoService -> AppUserRepository: findById(userId)
    AppUserRepository --> TodoService: Optional<AppUser>

    alt Optional is empty (user not found)
        TodoService --> TodoController: throw ResourceNotFoundException
        TodoController --> GEH: ResourceNotFoundException
        GEH --> Client: 404 Not Found
    else User found
        TodoService -> TodoService: todo = Todo.builder().user(user).title(..).description(..).status(PENDING).build()
        TodoService -> TodoRepository: save(todo)
        TodoRepository --> TodoService: saved Todo
        TodoService -> TodoService: TodoResponse.from(savedTodo)
        TodoService --> TodoController: TodoResponse
        TodoController --> Client: 201 Created (TodoResponse)
    end
end
@enduml